<section class="chapter service-chapter" data-view id="services"><nav class="trail"><a href="#top" data-i18n="directoryHome">Home</a> <i aria-hidden="true">/</i> <span data-i18n="serviceHome">Services</span></nav><header class="services-head"><h1><span data-i18n="serviceDirectory">Services for your app</span></h1><p class="chapter-lead"><span data-i18n="serviceIntro">Where is your app today? Choose the part you want our community to run.</span></p></header>
<div class="service-routes">
<a class="service-route" href="#services/testing"><span class="service-stage"><span data-i18n="serviceTrack">Before release</span></span><div><h2><span data-i18n="serviceClosed">Private closed testing</span></h2><p><span data-i18n="serviceClosedBlurb">We bring the testers, run the cycle and help you apply for production access.</span></p></div><div class="service-route-end"><small><span data-i18n="serviceFrom">From</span> <b>$<span data-price="crypto">20</span></b></small><strong><span data-i18n="serviceStart">Set up a test</span></strong></div></a>
<a class="service-route" href="#services/growth"><span class="service-stage"><span data-i18n="serviceLive">After release</span></span><div><h2><span data-i18n="serviceGrowth">Growth with a coordinator</span></h2><p><span data-i18n="serviceGrowthBlurb">Delegate the daily exchanges while you shape the next release.</span></p></div><div class="service-route-end"><strong><span data-i18n="serviceExplore">Meet the format</span></strong></div></a></div>
<p class="service-exit"><span data-i18n="serviceAlternative">Prefer to work with other developers yourself?</span> <a href="#community"><span data-i18n="serviceMutual">Explore the community</span></a></p></section>
<section class="chapter service-chapter" data-view id="services/testing"><nav class="trail"><a href="#top" data-i18n="directoryHome">Home</a> <i aria-hidden="true">/</i> <a href="#services"><span data-i18n="serviceHome">Services</span></a></nav><header class="checkout-head"><div><h1><span data-i18n="serviceClosed">Private closed testing</span></h1><p class="chapter-lead"><span data-i18n="serviceReady">Share the link to your closed track. We’ll coordinate the people and the daily testing.</span></p></div><button class="button button-outline button-small" data-open-drawer="guide" type="button"><span data-i18n="serviceGuide">Play Console setup guide</span></button></header>
<div class="checkout-layout"><div id="page-checkout-slot"><div class="wizard-card checkout-editor" id="checkout-editor"><div class="wizard-top"><span id="draft-indicator" class="draft-indicator" data-i18n="draftSaved">Draft saved on this device</span></div><ol class="stepper" aria-label="Order steps"><li aria-current="step" data-step-label="1"><b>1</b><span data-i18n="stepApp">App details</span></li><li data-step-label="2"><b>2</b><span data-i18n="stepSetup">Play Console</span></li><li data-step-label="3"><b>3</b><span data-i18n="stepPayment">Payment</span></li></ol>
    <div id="resume-banner" class="notice" hidden><span data-i18n="resumeDraft">Your saved draft is ready. Check the details and continue.</span><button class="text-button" type="button" id="clear-draft" data-i18n="clearDraft">Clear draft</button></div>
<form id="order-form" novalidate>
<section data-step="1" aria-labelledby="app-step-title"><h3 id="app-step-title"><span data-i18n="serviceDetails">App details</span></h3><div id="project-picker-wrap" hidden><label for="project-picker"><span data-i18n="serviceSelect">Use a project from your account</span></label><select id="project-picker"><option value="" data-i18n="manualEntry">Enter manually</option></select></div><div hidden aria-hidden="true">
        <input type="checkbox" name="detailsConfirmed" checked>
        <input type="checkbox" name="linkConfirmed" checked>
        <input type="checkbox" name="groupConfirmed" checked>
        <input type="checkbox" name="countriesConfirmed" checked>
        <input type="checkbox" name="reviewConfirmed" checked>
      </div>

<div class="app-pair"><div><label for="app-name" data-i18n="appName">App name</label><input id="app-name" name="appName" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" required></div>
<fieldset><legend data-i18n="appType">App type</legend><div class="choice-row"><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="appType" value="free" checked><span data-i18n="freeApp">Free app</span></label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="appType" value="paid"><span data-i18n="paidApp">Paid app</span></label></div></fieldset></div><div class="inset-panel" id="license-panel" hidden><p><span data-i18n="servicePaidHelp">Set up License Testing so testers can install this paid build.</span> <button class="button button-outline button-small" data-open-drawer="guide" type="button"><span data-i18n="serviceGuide">Play Console setup guide</span></button></p><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="licenseConfirmed"><span data-i18n="licenseConfirm">I have configured License Testing for this paid app.</span></label></div></section>
<section data-step="2" aria-labelledby="setup-step-title"><h3 id="setup-step-title" data-i18n="setupTitle">Connect your closed test</h3><label for="testing-link"><span data-i18n="serviceLink">Closed testing link</span></label><input id="testing-link" name="testingLink" type="text" placeholder="com.example.app" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" required aria-describedby="link-format"><p id="link-format" class="field-help"><span data-i18n="serviceLinkHelp">Paste a testing link, store URL or</span> <code>Package ID</code>.</p><p id="normalized-link" class="normalized-link notranslate" translate="no" hidden></p><div class="drawer-track-guide"><button class="button button-outline button-small" data-open-drawer="guide" type="button"><span data-i18n="serviceGuide">Play Console setup guide</span></button></div><div class="review-option"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="fullReview"><strong><span data-i18n="serviceOption">Add a full app review</span></strong> <b class="review-total" data-i18n="serviceTotal">$75 total</b></label><p><span data-i18n="serviceReportScope">Device coverage, UX findings and a prioritized fix plan.</span> <a href="sample-report.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-i18n="serviceSample">View a sample report</span></a></p></div></section>
<section data-step="3" aria-labelledby="payment-step-title"><h3 id="payment-step-title"><span data-i18n="serviceChoosePay">Payment</span></h3><div id="standard-payment"><p id="commerce-state" class="field-help" role="status" data-i18n="loadingPrices">Checking current prices…</p><button type="button" class="text-button" id="retry-commerce" hidden data-i18n="retry">Try again</button><div class="notice" id="login-reminder"><span data-i18n="loginBeforePayment">Sign in with Telegram before paying or submitting your order.</span> <a href="#account" data-i18n="signIn">Sign in</a></div>
<fieldset><legend class="sr-only" data-i18n="paymentTitle">Choose your payment method</legend><div class="payment-methods"><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="paymentMethod" value="crypto" checked><span class="choice-inner"><span class="choice-title" data-i18n="crypto">Crypto</span> <b class="choice-price">$<span data-price="crypto">20</span></b></span></label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="paymentMethod" value="paypal"><span class="choice-inner"><span class="choice-title">PayPal</span> <b class="choice-price">$<span data-price="paypal">23</span></b></span></label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="paymentMethod" value="bank"><span class="choice-inner"><span class="choice-title" data-i18n="bank">Bank</span> <b class="choice-price">$<span data-price="bank">23</span></b></span></label></div></fieldset>

<div id="payment-instructions">      <div data-payment="crypto" class="inset-panel"><label for="exchange" data-i18n="selectExchange">Choose your exchange</label><select name="exchange" id="exchange"><option value="binance">Binance</option><option value="bybit">ByBit</option><option value="okx">OKX</option><option value="htx">HTX</option><option value="gate">Gate</option></select><p data-i18n="internalTransfer">Send an internal USDT transfer inside the selected exchange. This is an exchange UID, not a blockchain wallet address.</p><div class="copy-row"><div><span id="exchange-label" class="small notranslate">Binance ID</span><code id="exchange-uid">967321648</code></div><button type="button" class="text-button" id="copy-uid" data-i18n="copy">Copy</button></div><a id="exchange-link" class="button button-outline" href="https://www.binance.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="openExchange">Open exchange</a></div>
      <div data-payment="paypal" class="inset-panel" hidden><p data-i18n="paypalInstructions">Pay $23 ($20 + $3 fee), then come back and attach your receipt.</p><a id="paypal-link" class="button button-primary" href="https://paypal.me/devtesthub/23USD" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="payPaypal">Pay $23 with PayPal</a><details><summary data-i18n="manualPaypal">Prefer a manual transfer?</summary><div class="copy-row"><code>pay.hubstation@gmail.com</code><button type="button" class="text-button" data-copy="pay.hubstation@gmail.com" data-i18n="copy">Copy</button></div><a href="https://www.paypal.com/myaccount/transfer/homepage/pay" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="openPaypal">Open PayPal</a></details></div>
      <div data-payment="bank" class="inset-panel" hidden><p data-i18n="bankInstructions">The manager converts $23 to your local currency and sends the exact amount and payment details in Telegram.</p><label for="currency" data-i18n="currency">Payment currency</label><select name="currency" id="currency"><option value="TRY">TRY — Türkiye</option><option value="BYN">BYN — Belarus</option><option value="KZT">KZT — Kazakhstan</option><option value="KGS">KGS — Kyrgyzstan</option><option value="VND">VND — Vietnam</option><option value="RUB">RUB — Russia</option></select><label for="bank-name" data-i18n="bankName">Your bank</label><input name="bankName" id="bank-name" maxlength="80" placeholder="Ziraat, Kaspi, T-Bank…"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="personalAccount" checked><span data-i18n="personalAccount">Paying from a personal account</span></label><button type="button" class="button button-outline" id="request-requisites" data-i18n="requestRequisites">Request bank payment details</button><div id="bank-order" hidden><p id="bank-order-label" class="notranslate" translate="no"></p><a id="manager-chat" class="button button-outline" href="https://t.me/garantXchange" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="openManager">Chat with @garantXchange</a><p class="small" data-i18n="bankWaiting">After receiving the details and paying, attach your receipt below.</p></div></div>
      <div class="receipt-dropzone" id="receipt-dropzone">
        <input id="receipt" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" class="receipt-file-input" aria-labelledby="receipt-label">
        <div class="receipt-dropzone-content" id="receipt-dropzone-idle">
          <div class="receipt-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="9" y1="15" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg></div>
          <strong id="receipt-label" data-i18n="uploadReceiptTitle">Attach payment receipt</strong>
          <p data-i18n="serviceReceiptFormat">PNG, JPEG or WebP · up to 5 MB</p>
        </div>
        <div class="receipt-dropzone-selected" id="receipt-dropzone-selected" hidden>
          <img id="receipt-preview" class="receipt-preview-thumb" alt="Receipt preview">
          <div class="receipt-selected-details">
            <p id="receipt-info" class="receipt-file-name notranslate" translate="no"></p>
            <span class="badge-status badge-valid" data-i18n="receiptReady">Receipt attached</span>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="text-button button-tiny" id="receipt-remove-btn" data-i18n="removeAccount">Remove</button>
        </div>
      </div>
<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="paymentConfirmed"><span data-i18n="servicePaymentConfirm">I paid the amount shown for this app.</span></label></div></div>
<div id="managed-payment" hidden><p><span data-i18n="serviceManual">The coordinator confirms the scope and sends payment details in Telegram.</span></p><a class="button button-primary" id="managed-order-link" href="https://t.me/garantXchange" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-i18n="serviceHuman">Arrange test and review in Telegram · $75</span></a></div></section>
<div id="wizard-error" class="error-message" role="alert" hidden tabindex="-1"></div><div id="wizard-success" class="success-message" role="status" hidden></div><div class="wizard-footer"><button type="button" class="button button-quiet" id="wizard-back" hidden data-i18n="back">Back</button><button type="submit" class="button button-primary" id="wizard-next" data-i18n="submitOrder">Place order</button></div></form></div></div><aside class="plan-box"><h2><span data-i18n="servicePlan">Your testing plan</span></h2><p class="plan-price"><strong class="notranslate" id="plan-amount">$20</strong><small><span data-i18n="servicePriceUnit">per app</span></small></p><ul><li><span data-i18n="serviceDevices">12+ real Android devices</span></li><li><span data-i18n="serviceDays">14+ days of closed testing, usually 15</span></li><li><span data-i18n="serviceQuestions">Help answering the production access questionnaire</span></li></ul><p class="plan-guarantee"><span data-i18n="serviceGuarantee">We keep testing until you get access, or refund you.</span></p><small class="plan-estimate"><span data-i18n="serviceRate">Our team estimates that 99% pass on the first application. Google makes the decision.</span></small><div class="plan-other"><a class="button button-outline" id="stars-order" data-bot-link="private" href="https://t.me/Android12TestersBot/app?startapp=guaranteed_test" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-i18n="serviceStars">Pay with Telegram Stars</span></a><details><summary><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ </span><span data-i18n="serviceWhyStars">Why Stars?</span></summary><p><span data-i18n="serviceStarsPolicy">Telegram uses Stars for digital services sold inside the bot. On this site you can pay with crypto, PayPal or a bank transfer.</span></p></details></div><a class="coordinator-help" href="https://t.me/garantXchange" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-i18n="serviceHelp">Contact the coordinator</span></a></aside></div></section>
<section class="chapter service-chapter" id="services/growth" data-view><nav class="trail"><a href="#top" data-i18n="directoryHome">Home</a> <i aria-hidden="true">/</i> <a href="#services"><span data-i18n="serviceHome">Services</span></a></nav><header class="services-head"><p class="service-stage">Google Play · Live</p><h1><span data-i18n="serviceGrowth">Growth with a coordinator</span></h1><p class="chapter-lead"><span data-i18n="serviceGrowthLead">Give us one live app and a user journey worth testing. A coordinator organizes the exchanges and keeps your team moving.</span></p></header><dl class="growth-process"><div><dt><span data-i18n="serviceYou">Your part</span></dt><dd><span data-i18n="serviceYouBody">Send the store link, tell us who the app is for and which flow you want to improve. Agree on scope and timing directly with the coordinator.</span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-i18n="serviceTeam">Our part</span></dt><dd><span data-i18n="serviceTeamBody">The coordinator handles reciprocal commitments, follows up on reports and keeps the activity visible in the bot.</span></dd></div><div><dt><span data-i18n="serviceMeasure">Track the outcome</span></dt><dd><span data-i18n="serviceMeasureBody">Review findings from real devices alongside your own Play Console data. Use both to decide what to ship next.</span></dd></div></dl><a class="button button-primary" href="https://t.me/garantXchange" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-i18n="serviceDiscuss">Talk to a coordinator</span></a></section>